{
  "_about": "Profile screen (ProfileScene, user's pick D: docs/proposals/menu/profile-picked-D.png). defaults = a new player's name / profile hero / banner (saved in progress.profile). achievements: earned at the end of a run (systems/achievements.js), each with a medal (an item icon) and a short label; `when` = stat (lifetime, progress.stats or heroesUnlocked) >= value, boss = every listed boss beaten once, run = something in ONE run (legendaryItem, itemKinds, heroDamage, heroHealing, allReach = every hero lived to floor N). banners = crops of the title forest (systems/banners.js), `unlock` = an achievement id (null = from the start). nameMax = letters in a name. shortNames = hero names in the small hero tiles (long ones do not fit).",
